===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[box]] containing items, especially [[clothing]], table [[linens]], [[towels]], bed linens, and [[quilt]]s, typically stored by unmarried young women in anticipation of future [[marriage]]s or married lives.

====Usage notes====
The term "hope chest" may be used primarily by Midwestern American women. The term "glory box" is used by women in the United Kingdom and Australia.

